OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over scrutiny of nuclear
OL,4,Afactory plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FQuestions have been raised over whether
OL,7,FWest Berkshire Council has the
OL,8,Fexpertise and resources needed to
OL,9,Fscrutinise plans for a major
OL,10,Fredevelopment at the Atomic Weapons
OL,11,FEstablishment (AWE) in Aldermaston.
OL,13,FThe nuclear weapons site is expected to
OL,14,Fsubmit plans for its Future Materials
OL,15,FCampus, part of a wider #15bn
OL,16,Finvestment in the UK's warhead
OL,17,Fprogramme.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
