OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over scrutiny of nuclear
OL,4,Afactory plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a meeting on Thursday,
OL,7,FConservative councillor Dominic Boeck
OL,8,Fsaid residents had concerns about the
OL,9,Fimpact of the project and asked how the
OL,10,Fauthority would independently assess an
OL,11,Fapplication of such scale and
OL,12,Fcomplexity.
OL,14,FLiberal Democrat deputy council leader
OL,15,FDenise Gaines said any proposal would
OL,16,Fbe examined by qualified professionals
OL,17,Fand specialist consultants to ensure
OL,18,Fall technical and environmental issues
OL,19,Fwere properly considered.
